Model 3: Craving Swap
Algorithm:
Cosine similarity on properly constructed ingredient flavour vectors.

Features:
- Flavour profile.
- Relevant molecule descriptors.
- Taste descriptors.
- Aroma descriptors.
- Ingredient category.
- Nutritional features for subsequent filtering.
Formula:

cosine_similarity(A,B) = (A · B) / (||A|| × ||B||)

Evaluate:
- Similarity ranking quality.
- Nutritional suitability.
- Ingredient availability.
- User acceptance.
Use actual API data.

Do not create arbitrary molecular feature vectors.
Model 4: Cycle Prediction
Initial algorithm:
Statistical baseline and Bayesian updating.

Features:
- Previous period start dates.
- Cycle lengths.
- Median cycle length.
- Mean cycle length.
- Standard deviation.
- Recent cycle trend.
- Missing or irregular observations.
Future algorithm:
