FEMnourish – Pre-Development Analysis & Architecture Plan
1. Understanding of FEMnourish
FEMnourish is a cycle-aware women’s wellness and nutrition ecosystem — not a period tracker or recipe site. It connects menstrual cycle tracking, PCOS/PCOD-conscious nutrition, computational gastronomy (via Foodoscope APIs), personalized meal planning, flavor-based craving substitutions, movement recommendations, symptom forecasting, and grocery planning into one integrated platform.

The first experience is a guided, conversational intake (like a first consultation with a dietitian), starting with age, then branching through cycle history, PCOS/PCOD status, symptoms, sexual/reproductive health context, dietary preferences, lifestyle, and goals — one question at a time.

